00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:00.880
#Wasurenai@irc.rizon.net

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:08.240
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:15.310
So this is the academy that everyone wanted to go to.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.350
I'm really looking forward to it, Ma-kun.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.410
Stop calling me Ma-kun.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:24.380
It was rare to see boys making sweets when we were in elementary school.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.450
But in this place, everyone is aiming to become a pâtissier.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:29.130
We all have the same dream.

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:31.240
It's great if we can make some good allies.

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:36.000
I don't care, I didn't come here to make allies.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:36.790
But...

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:38.500
Everyone here is my rival.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:41.930
What's this?

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:44.410
She's the Queen of the Sweets Spirits.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:50.870
There is a legend that if you see Sweets Spirits, your wishes will come true.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:55.890
Nonsense. If it just needs that to make a wish come true, we won't need to work hard.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.890
But, if they really exist, I want to see them.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:00.350
If they exists, the more they shouldn't come out.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:05.070
Hey, Sweets Spirits. I'm going to be the top of this academy.

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:08.730
Even without meeting you all, I'll become a top-class pâtissier.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.070
Such confidence.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.830
W-What was that voice?

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.840
Could that be the Sweets Spirits?

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.300
Obviously not.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.720
Show your face already.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:26.040
Students who wish to become pâtissiers gather here from all over the country.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:30.470
I don't think it'll be that easy to get to the top.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:31.760
Who the heck are you?

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.410
I am...

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:41.570
Pleased to meet you. I'm Hanabusa Satsuki.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.480
Take this as a token of our new friendship.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.940
Thank you!

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.170
Pleased to meet you. Pleased to meet you. And you, as well.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:50.330
Um...

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:54.500
Ah, I apologise, but ladies first. You'll come afterwards.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.150
I don't need allies.

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:02.180
Especially  him<i>. I'll never get along with him.</i>

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:08.180
recipe 11

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:08.180
The Prince's Friendship Madeleines

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.920
The Prince's Friendship Madeleines.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:11.850
This room's mine. You're next door, Ma-kun.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.440
Right. See you later.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.410
What the heck is this?

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.110
So <i>you</i> are Kashino-kun.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:30.000
It's you!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.490
I'm your roommate, Hanabusa.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:34.930
Thanks for earlier.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.660
You did this, didn't you?

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:41.660
Yes. I coordinated the room decorations.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:47.910
A beautiful room needs beautiful flowers to give a breath of fresh air to our lifestyle.

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:50.680
I prepared this in order to welcome you.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.170
How is it? Isn't the room just wonderful?

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:54.790
You've got bad taste.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:05:01.040
Perhaps something is wrong with your sense of art if you can't see how wonderful this is.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.830
You just put up decorations.

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.690
I prefer things simple.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:10.490
Sweets aren't only about taste. A beautiful presentation is also important.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.030
Are you really suitable to become a pâtissier?

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:16.490
What did you say!?

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:23.710
Wait a minute! Let's talk this over! We'll be able to talk it out, right?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.250
Right? Right?

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.280
If you cross this boundary line...

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:32.080
...there'll be a price to pay!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.500
Well then, I'll announce the members of A-group first.

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:44.340
They are the people who scored the highest on the school entrance exam.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:47.180
Please come forward when I call your names.

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:49.280
Kashino-kun.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.080
Here.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.080
Andou-kun.

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.230
Hanabusa-kun.

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:01.050
Those three of them are totally cool, aren't they!?

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:04.720
They're smart and really good at making sweets. That's awesome!

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:08.680
Three handsome boys making sweets, aren't they "The Sweets Princes"!

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.930
Sweets Princes!

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.290
We're in the same group, too?

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:13.340
This is the worst.

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:17.270
I couldn't agree with you more.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.930
We're in the same group, so let's get along, okay?

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:23.600
Those are the basics for making Madeleines.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:27.860
Please use your imagination, and try baking you own Madeleines.

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:33.330
Hey, I was just about to take that!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.540
First come, first serve.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.110
Pardon me.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:43.650
What are you're doing?

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:44.670
My hands slipped.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.910
Your methods are really childish. Brat!

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:49.200
You're the one who started it!

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.540
No, you were!

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:52.740
You idiot! The flour will become sticky!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.050
Both of you, stop it!

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:58.160
What are you three doing!?

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:03.820
We don't have enough tools for each of you!

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:07.020
You are to share the limited tools you have.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.890
Don't you even understand that?

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:10.060
I'm sorry.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:13.740
The three of you are prohibited from using the cooking classroom for three days as punishment.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:15.420
Me too?

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:16.210
Wait a minute!

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:19.800
And after school, you all have to write a reflection of what you did and pass it up.

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:20.740
Understood?

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:21.950
I just can't take it.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:25.950
I came here to study how to become a pâtissier and I can't make sweets...

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.610
Shut up.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.740
If you don't plan on reflecting on your behavior, then leave.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:31.170
I won't let you order me around.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:35.030
Oh my, even a monkey knows how to reflect on its behavior.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.170
You're even lower than a monkey.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.240
Huh? Say that again!!

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.040
No fighting! Call it a truce.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:45.910
How energetic. Alright, that'll do, that'll do.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:49.470
Who?

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:51.910
He gave us a welcoming message during the entrance ceremony, remember?

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.420
He's the Chairman of this Academy!

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.400
Can we help you with something?

00:07:55.710 --> 00:08:01.910
If you like, why don't we have a nice chat while eating sweets?

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.220
While eating sweets?

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:08.000
If you do that, you'll be able to understand many things.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.200
I didn't come here to <i>eat</i> sweets, I came here to <i>make</i> them!

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.720
Hey! You haven't finished writing your reflection yet!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.500
Kashino!

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:21.940
Kashino, this is bad.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:24.720
They said we were forbidden from using the cooking classroom.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.180
I just want to practice a little.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:29.480
That's why I came to this school!

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.490
Kashino!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:34.000
You really are self-centered.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.940
So all that matters to you is your own goals?

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.810
I want to become a top-class pâtissier as soon as I can! And that's that.

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:41.400
I like what I hear!

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:46.750
A butterfly?

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.350
I like your determination.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.580
Pleased to meet you. My name is Cafe.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.470
I came from the Kingdom of Sweets!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.760
Could you be a Sweets Spirit?

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:02.260
Oui.

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:05.950
So you really do exist! It's an honour to meet you.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:10.560
Likewise. You want to bring sweets and people who enjoy them together.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:11.920
I feel the same way too.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:14.790
I see. It seems we'll get along well.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:20.780
M-M-My name is Caramel...

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.140
Are you alright?

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:28.380
I'm only a girl but I look forward to working together.

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.560
Tastes rather good.

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:38.140
I have made my decision. Kashino, I give you the title of my partner!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.460
Partner?

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:43.640
Sweets Spirits have to pair together with humans and make sweets together.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:47.920
In order for me to become a Court Pâtissière in the Kingdom of Sweets,

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:50.420
and for you, in order to become a top-class pâtissier.

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:53.540
Let's work together and realize both of our dreams!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.700
My name is Chocolat. Pleased to meet you.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:57.550
I don't need any partners!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.510
You want to realize your dream, right? Then we'll work toge-

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.510
Dreams are things you make come true on your own.

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.240
I don't need your help.

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:06.240
I'm shocked!

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:08.240
What are you three doing!?

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:13.680
I believe I prohibited you all from using the cooking classroom.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:14.750
You have broken that rule.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.670
Wait a minute! He's the only one who was using...

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:20.010
All of you are in the same group, right?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.270
You all share the responsibilities.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:25.030
As punishment, you all won't have your dinner tonight.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:27.080
You are all confined to your dorm rooms.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:30.020
As well as a three day suspension from classes.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.940
Satsuki, how about some coffee?

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.580
It'll help to lighten your mood.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:58.180
Thank you, Cafe-kun. But, I don't need any now.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.130
I wonder if those two are alright?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.200
Are you alright?

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:08.230
I'm really sorry, always causing trouble for you.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:11.010
I just thought I'd help to tidy up.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.510
What's that pretty box?

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:18.450
That's a present that my brother gave to me when I left home.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:20.240
I haven't looked at it. Wanna open it?

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.340
Of course.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.070
I wonder what's inside it?

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:31.570
Caramel!

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:35.380
What's the matter?

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.040
Caramel flew out into the forest! I'm going to look for her!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:41.270
We're confined to our rooms! If a teacher catches you...

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:42.080
I can't just leave her!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.780
I wonder if she's alright... Caramel has a terrible sense of direction...

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:49.930
If they get lost in the forest, will the two of them be able to make it out safely?

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:55.930
If you go, you're going to get expelled.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.100
Leaving without permission is completely against the rules.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:05.280
Moreover, if you leave while you are confined to your room, you'll definitely be expelled.

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:08.660
If you leave now, I say you're a fool.

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:12.990
I'm fine with being a fool.

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:16.490
Kashino, wait for me!

00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:31.010
Where am I?

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:38.560
Huh?

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:44.120
No...

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:49.170
That was a close call.

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:50.300
Andou!

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:51.780
I'm glad you're safe.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:52.700
Are you unhurt?

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:54.340
Yes...

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.700
You were looking for me?

00:12:57.090 --> 00:13:00.540
Yeah. Because we're partners after all, right?

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.040
Andou!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.180
This is the end of our misunderstanding, okay?

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.280
Then, let's go home.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:12.590
Andou! Andou!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:15.180
H-Hey, wait up!

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.620
Geez...

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.260
Where... did he go?

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:27.810
Hey.

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:30.650
You're scared, right?

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:32.740
Then go back already.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.950
I am your partner!

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:38.740
Your partner has to act together with you!

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:40.600
I don't accept you.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:43.750
I don't care if you don't accept it! It's my decision!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:47.560
We're going to work hard, and make our dreams come true, together!

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:51.460
So I'm going to come with you, even if I'm a little scared!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.990
Hold on tightly.

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:02.430
I don't want any more lost children.

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:07.480
Then, Kashino! Let's go!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:09.980
Okay, okay.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:16.710
Andou, are you alright?

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:17.820
Andou!

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.480
I think I bruised my leg.

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:22.290
I think it's a bit difficult to climb over this.

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:25.010
I'm sorry!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.140
This is all my fault!

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:28.830
It's not your fault, Caramel.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:32.020
It's my fault for not warning you properly.

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:33.210
Andou...

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.990
What are you doing?

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:40.800
I'm whistling.

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.980
It's a signal to my childhood friend.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.720
I can hear something.

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:53.890
That's Andou!

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:04.910
This is bad... I can't see properly, it's too dark.

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:07.320
Leave that to me!

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:10.590
A fork?

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:19.330
This is...

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.610
It's Sweets Spirits magic!

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:25.180
Now, let's head to where Andou is!

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:29.200
Thank you, Chocolat.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:33.660
T-This kind of thing is peanuts to me.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:34.650
Let's hurry!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.050
Yeah.

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:46.080
Andou!

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:47.300
Kashino!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.050
Caramel, you have to be more careful!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.640
Because of your terrible sense of direction!

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:56.300
Chocolat! You came for me even though you're a scaredy-cat! Thank you so much!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.400
Scaredy-cat was uncalled for.

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:00.430
What's the matter, Andou? You can't stand?

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.010
Wait for me.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.100
Why did you come? If we're found out, we'll get expelled.

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:14.400
When we finally managed to enter...

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:15.780
Quiet.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.000
Get on.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:17.730
But...

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.280
Just get on already.

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:23.140
Hold on tight!

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:23.930
Right.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:31.910
Sorry. I'm heavy, aren't I?

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:34.270
Yeah, really heavy!

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:36.600
And I used to be bigger than you!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.810
Ma-kun, you never change...

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.610
You're always dependable when trouble arises.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.610
We're going to graduate and become pâtissiers together, right?

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:48.210
We don't have time to waste around here!

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:49.910
Heave, ho!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:51.690
Kashino, just a bit more!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.550
You...

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.300
I'm going to pull you two now.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.430
One, two.

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:20.630
Why did you come?

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:24.160
When you said <i>I</i>  was a fool...

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.350
Well, I thought you were one.

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:34.330
But an idiot who'd risk being expelled to rescue his friend, and the kind person that'd go searching for his lost Spirit...

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.780
I don't hate them.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:40.040
This situation, don't you think it's kind of beautiful?

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:41.490
Conceited.

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:42.400
Full of excuses.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:46.160
We can talk later! We have to get back or else...

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.040
But, how do we get back?

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:50.920
If we pass in front of the dorm superintendent's room, we'll be discovered right away!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.440
If that's the problem, it's solved.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.870
Good job, Cafe-kun.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:04.940
You're welcome.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.370
W-What is it?

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:11.770
Right back at you.

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.940
It's suffering without eating dinner.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.940
You guys have some lively stomachs.

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.300
C-Chairman?

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:26.240
Oh, no! We're confined in our rooms, and now the Chairman's found us!

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:27.190
Are we running?

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:29.210
It's no use, he saw our faces.

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:30.990
Expelled...

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.350
What a beautiful moon.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:37.250
My stomach is grumbling before I even realised it.

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:47.150
All the teachers have gone home,

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:50.430
but the cooking classroom is always open.

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:54.750
So that students who want to, can practice making sweets.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.420
Andou, your leg's hurting, right?

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:06.400
Don't push yourself.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:10.700
Yeah. But I want to make Madeleines with you and Hanabusa-kun.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.340
Just call me Hanabusa, Andou.

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:15.930
We're all in the same group, after all.

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.420
Thanks, Hanabusa.

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:21.480
I'll wash up.

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.690
What's with him, all of a sudden?

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.500
It's his way of thanking you. He doesn't show his feelings honestly-

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:31.870
Andou, anything you need washed, pass over here.

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:33.140
Sure, thank you.

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:35.570
Caramel, take that one please.

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:36.970
Sure!

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.800
Itadakimasu.

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:56.000
Delicious! These Madeleines are incredible!

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.260
This is really good!

00:19:58.260 --> 00:20:04.080
I'm moved! Being in the same group with people who can make such delicious Madeleines makes me so happy.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.030
How about some caramel tea?

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:10.030
Coffee fits perfectly with sweet Madeleines.

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:12.130
Cocoa is perfect when you're tired.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.780
Thank you.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:15.210
Leave that there for me.

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.160
Hey, what'd you put in here?

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.880
Tea leaves and apples.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:20.060
Is this maccha?

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.320
Itadakimasu!

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:23.290
That's right. My family runs a Japanese confectionery.

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:24.150
Now I understand.

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:31.310
As soon as we ate each other Madeleines, we opened up our hearts to one another.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.660
Oh, so that's what happened.

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:40.750
Then, let me introduce you to these Madeleines I just made again!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.170
Will you eat my strawberry flavoured Madeleines?

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:48.210
They're no good?

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:49.480
It didn't expand enough.

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:50.800
It's a little too sweet.

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:52.920
Huh? I wonder what went wrong?

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:58.470
When using fruits, you have to take into account the natural moisture and sugar present in the fruit...

00:20:58.470 --> 00:21:02.600
Geez, it's a wasted effort for not knowing the steps yet!

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:04.850
I think she wanted to challenge herself!

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:09.440
Why not? It's more fun when everyone makes different kinds of sweets.

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:12.260
The more friends you have, the more discoveries you'll make.

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:16.110
I'm so happy that A-group now has four people!

